{"id":"en-23","title":"Unboxing The X Series","family":"x-series","topic":"getting-started","read_minutes":1,"source_url":"https://wiki.1laser.com/en/x-series/unboxing","source_updated_at":"2025-11-19T08:12:17.509Z","body_html":"<div><h2 id=\"unboxing-the-x-series\"> Unboxing The X Series</h2>\n<p>Follow this step-by-step guide to unbox, set up, and prepare your <a href=\"https://www.1laser.com/collections/x-series\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OneLaser X Series</a> for its first use, ensuring safe and smooth operation.</p><div>\n\n</div><h2 id=\"unbox-steps\"> Unbox Steps</h2><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 1: </strong>Cut cable tie.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_1_cut_cable_tie.jpg\" alt=\"Cutting the cable tie during OneLaser X Series unboxing step 1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> After removing the carton packaging, you can move the machine to your workbench.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_2_carton_packaging.jpg\" alt=\"Removing carton packaging and placing OneLaser X Series on workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Remove the protective film.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_3_remove_the_protective_film.jpg\" alt=\"Peeling off protective film from OneLaser X Series machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 4: </strong>Remove all items included and remove the inner foam.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_4_remove_all_items_1.jpg\" alt=\"Unboxing interior items of OneLaser X Series and removing foam packaging\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_4_remove_all_items_2.jpg\" alt=\"Removing internal foam inserts and accessories from OneLaser X Series\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 5:</strong> Confirm all items.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_5_confirm_all_items_1.jpg\" alt=\"Checking OneLaser X Series included accessories and components\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_5_confirm_all_items_2.jpg\" alt=\"Laid-out items included in OneLaser X Series packaging for confirmation\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><ul>\n  <li>Please refer to the items of the tool bag here → [Tool Bag Included Parts].</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 6: </strong>Disassemble the back box and add distilled water to the water tank.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>If your equipment is XRF series, you can ignore steps 6–7.</li>\n  <li>Remove the screws using an M2.5 screwdriver and take off the rear box cover. Please keep the removed screws.</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_6_disassemble_the_back_box_1.jpg\" alt=\"Removing screws to open back box of OneLaser X Series machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_6_disassemble_the_back_box_2.jpg\" alt=\"Taking off rear box cover to access water tank on X Series XT model\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 7: </strong>Locate the water tank and use a funnel to add distilled or purified water.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_7_locate_the_water_tank.jpg\" alt=\"Locating water tank and adding distilled water into OneLaser XT cooling system\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><ul>\n  <li>After the water filling is completed, please remember to install the rear cover back.</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 8:</strong> Installation of exhaust outlet.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>First, remove the screws on the plate.</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_8_installation_of_exhaust_outlet_1.jpg\" alt=\"Removing screws to prepare OneLaser X Series exhaust outlet installation\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><ul>\n  <li>Connect the 24V connector.</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_8_installation_of_exhaust_outlet_2.jpg\" alt=\"Connecting 24V power connector for X Series exhaust outlet module\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><ul>\n  <li>Install the exhaust outlet.</li>\n</ul><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_8_installation_of_exhaust_outlet_3.jpg\" alt=\"Installing the exhaust outlet onto OneLaser X Series rear panel\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 9:</strong> Install the exhaust pipe.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_9_install_the_exhaust_pipe.jpg\" alt=\"Attaching exhaust pipe to OneLaser X Series exhaust port\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>Step 10:</strong> Connect the power cable, USB cable, and camera cable.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/step_10_connect.jpg\" alt=\"Connecting power, USB, and camera cables to OneLaser X Series machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure>\n</div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"unboxing-the-x-series","text":"Unboxing The X Series"},{"level":2,"id":"unbox-steps","text":"Unbox Steps"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}